@host = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Reset the demo wallet to $1100
POST {{host}}/api/demo/wallets/{{userId}}/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "balance": 1100
}

### Read the wallet
GET {{host}}/api/wallets/{{userId}}

### Charge $1000. Send this twice, in parallel, with two different event ids.
POST {{host}}/api/wallets/{{userId}}/debits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaa1",
  "amount": 1000
}

### Second concurrent charge. Same user, different event id.
POST {{host}}/api/wallets/{{userId}}/debits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbb2",
  "amount": 1000
}

### Replay the first event. The balance must not change.
POST {{host}}/api/wallets/{{userId}}/debits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaa1",
  "amount": 1000
}

### Outcomes
GET {{host}}/api/wallets/{{userId}}/debits

### Ledger (only the charge that was applied)
GET {{host}}/api/wallets/{{userId}}/ledger
